   "zh": "横行蟹",
   "en": "Cleo the Crab"
  },
  "t": "你好！我是横行蟹。我每天走路去码头，要十分钟。你怎么去学校？",
  "r": "nǐ hǎo! wǒ shì héng xíng xiè. wǒ měi tiān zǒu lù qù mǎ tóu, yào shí fēn zhōng. nǐ zěn me qù xué xiào?",
  "zh": "",
  "en": "Hello! I'm Cleo the crab. Every day I walk to the harbour; it takes ten minutes. How do you get to school?"
 },
